boericke_materia_medica","section":"mind","label":"Mind","startLine":8092,"endLine":8094,"text":"Absent-minded, irritable, irresolute, lacks\nself-confidence. Fearful."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"head","label":"Head","startLine":8095,"endLine":8098,"text":"Vertigo, head cold, especially at vertex; ca-\ntarrh of nose and posterior nares, discharge thick, yel-\nlow, hard crusts. Corneal exudation."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"stomach","label":"Stomach","startLine":8099,"endLine":8103,"text":"Sensation of coldness, especially when\nempty. Sinking sensation at pit. Great thirst. Flatu-\nlence and distention after eating. Vomiting and eruc-\ntations."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"female","label":"Female","startLine":8104,"endLine":8106,"text":"Uterus heavy, prolapsed. Leucorrhoea,\npainful and irregular menses. Flow between periods."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"respiratory","label":"Respiratory","startLine":8107,"endLine":8112,"text":"Sensitive to cold air. Difficult res-\npiration. Chronic irritation of air passages. Copious,\nyellow-green mums. Coughs with coldness, weakness,\nemaciation, sensitiveness and peevishness, worse from\ncold air. Pain in chest walls."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"skin","label":"Skin","startLine":8113,"endLine":8115,"text":"Itching, burning, cold and blue, very sensi-\ntive. Pimples, comedones, wens. Psoric eruptions."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":8116,"endLine":8118,"text":"Compare: Arsenic; Tnbercul.; Baryt.\ncarh.; lod."}],"corpusPassages":[]}